      "writtenOn": "2019-03-21T21:33:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I know. I actually really like the explicit name there, as I think unions are often easy to miss, and time-consuming to debug. Having that little identifier there gives folks looking at the uses of this structure that little hint that they\u0027re reaching through something unioned. There was also a time when anonymous structs and unions were less portable, though that\u0027s less of a concern these days.\n\nAnyway, if it\u0027s important I can remove it, but I think it\u0027s nice.",
