      "writtenOn": "2019-03-22T15:10:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we need to use the top bit of slp_s0ix_transitions to track if there was a timeout, or could we just have a separate flag to track this? Using a separate variable for the timeout flag will make the code simpler in places, so we don\u0027t have to `slp_s0ix_transitions \u0026 EC_HOST_RESUME_SLEEP_TRANSITIONS_MASK`",
      "revId": "1955e6cdea6cd1cecbc8e2cbf5ee4ffd3495f385",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
